           <t indent="0" pn="section-6.2.6-1">The name of the subregistry is &quot;6P CellOptions Bitmap&quot;.</t>
           <t indent="0" pn="section-6.2.6-2">The following note is included in this registry: &quot;In version 0 of the
-6top Protocol (6P) <xref target="RFC8480" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC8480"/>, there is an optional CellOptions field
+6top Protocol (6P) [RFC8480], there is an optional CellOptions field
 that is 8 bits in size.&quot;</t>
           <t indent="0" pn="section-6.2.6-3">Each entry in the subregistry must include a bit position in the
 range 0-7, the corresponding name, and a reference to the bit's
 documentation.</t>
           <t indent="0" pn="section-6.2.6-4">Initial entries in this subregistry are as follows:</t>
